(   - Atomic Packing Factor \(APF\):) Tj
T*
(   APF = [ 2 * \(4/3\)*pi*r^3 ] / a^3 = [ \(8/3\)*pi * \(a*sqrt\(3\)/4\)^3 ] / a^3 = [ \(8/3\)*pi *) Tj
T*
(   \(3*sqrt\(3\)/64\) ] = pi * sqrt\(3\) / 8 = 0.6802 =~ 68.0%.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Face-Centered Cubic \(FCC\) Structure:) Tj
T*
(   - Atoms per cell: 8 corners * \(1/8\) + 6 face centers * \(1/2\) = 1 + 3 = 4 atoms/cell.) Tj
T*
(   - Coordination Number \(CN\): In the face plane 4 neighbors, 4 in plane above, 4 in plane below) Tj
T*
(   => CN = 12.) Tj
T*
(   - Nearest neighbor contact: Atoms touch along face diagonal of length a*sqrt\(2\):) Tj
T*
(   4 * r = a * sqrt\(2\) => r = a * sqrt\(2\) / 4.) Tj
T*
(   - Atomic Packing Factor \(APF\):) Tj
T*
(   APF = [ 4 * \(4/3\)*pi*r^3 ] / a^3 = [ \(16/3\)*pi * \(a*sqrt\(2\)/4\)^3 ] / a^3 = [ \(16/3\)*pi *) Tj
T*
(   \(2*sqrt\(2\)/64\) ] = pi * sqrt\(2\) / 6 = 0.7405 =~ 74.0%.) Tj
T*
(   Conclusion: FCC is close-packed \(74.0%\), BCC is moderately packed \(68.0%\), and SC is loosely) Tj
T*
(   packed \(52.4%\).) Tj
T*
