(   [Problem Statement]: Explain the procedure for determining Miller Indices \(h k l\) of a crystal plane. Derive the formula for interplanar spacing d_hkl for a cubic crystal lattice.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Algorithm for Determining Miller Indices \(h k l\):) Tj
T*
(   - Step 1 \(Identify Intercepts\): Determine the coordinates of the intercepts of the crystal) Tj
T*
(   plane with the three crystallographic axes in terms of unit cell dimensions: p*a, q*b, r*c.) Tj
T*
(   - Step 2 \(Fractional Intercepts\): Divide by lattice constants to obtain dimensionless) Tj
T*
(   multipliers: p, q, r. If plane is parallel to an axis, intercept is infinity.) Tj
T*
