T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Type I \(Soft\) Superconductors:) Tj
T*
(   - Critical Field: Possesses a single, relatively low critical magnetic field H_c \(typically <) Tj
T*
(   0.1 Tesla\).) Tj
T*
(   - Transition: Completely superconducting for H < H_c; abruptly transforms into the normal) Tj
T*
(   resistive state for H > H_c.) Tj
T*
(   - Meissner Effect: Complete and perfect Meissner flux expulsion \(B = 0\) throughout the entire) Tj
T*
(   superconducting regime.) Tj
T*
(   - Coherence Length vs Penetration Depth: xi > lambda_L \(Ginzburg-Landau parameter kappa =) Tj
T*
(   lambda_L / xi < 1/sqrt\(2\) = 0.707\). Surface energy of normal-superconducting boundary is) Tj
T*
(   positive.) Tj
T*
