T*
(   - Regimes of Behavior:) Tj
T*
(   * H < H_c1: Perfect Meissner state \(B = 0\), complete flux expulsion.) Tj
T*
(   * H_c1 < H < H_c2: Mixed State \(Vortex / Shubnikov State\). Magnetic flux penetrates the bulk in) Tj
T*
