(   [Problem Statement]: Describe the DC and AC Josephson Effects across a Superconductor-Insulator-Superconductor \(S-I-S\) tunnel junction. State the fundamental equations for supercurrent and Josephson frequency.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Josephson Tunneling Phenomenon:) Tj
T*
(   In 1962, Brian Josephson predicted that Cooper pairs can tunnel quantum mechanically across an) Tj
T*
(   ultra-thin insulating barrier \(~ 1 to 2 nm\)) Tj
T*
(   separating two macroscopic superconductors without breaking.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. DC Josephson Effect:) Tj
T*
(   - If zero external DC voltage is applied across the junction \(V = 0\), a finite DC supercurrent) Tj
T*
(   I_s flows across the junction with zero electrical resistance:) Tj
T*
(   I_s = I_c * sin\( Delta phi \),) Tj
T*
(   where I_c is the maximum critical Josephson current, and Delta phi = phi2 - phi1 is the) Tj
T*
(   constant quantum mechanical phase difference between the macroscopic wave functions of the two) Tj
T*
(   superconductors.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. AC Josephson Effect:) Tj
T*
(   - If a constant DC voltage V is applied across the junction, the phase difference Delta phi) Tj
T*
(   advances continuously in time according to:) Tj
T*
(   d\(Delta phi\) / dt = \(2 * e * V\) / h_bar.) Tj
T*
(   - Integrating with respect to time: Delta phi\(t\) = Delta phi_0 + \(2 * e * V / h_bar\) * t.) Tj
T*
(   - Substituting into the supercurrent equation:) Tj
T*
(   I_s\(t\) = I_c * sin[ Delta phi_0 + \(2 * pi * f_J\) * t ],) Tj
T*
(   where the supercurrent oscillates sinusoidally at the Josephson frequency f_J:) Tj
T*
(   f_J = \( 2 * e * V \) / h = V / Phi_0.) Tj
T*
(   - Numerical Constant: f_J / V = 2 * e / h = 483,597.9 GHz / Volt = 483.6 MHz / microvolt.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Metrological Significance:) Tj
T*
(   Because f_J depends ONLY on fundamental invariant physical constants \(e and h\), the AC) Tj
T*
(   Josephson effect provides the international primary standard for the definition of the Volt.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
