(   - The crystal wave function is constructed as a linear combination: Psi_crystal = Sigma_i c_i *) Tj
T*
(   psi_atomic\(r - R_i\).) Tj
T*
(   - S-orbitals combine symmetrically \(bonding state, lower energy\) and antisymmetrically) Tj
T*
